#8100
Palanthas-Zone 81~
Made by Goth, this area was put in with Soth's Playground to offer
challenge to both good and evil characters. My intent is to make it a
link for possibly two more areas from TSR's Dragonlance storyline-
Daargaard Keep, and The High Clerists Tower. Note I have modified the
city of Palanthas slightly to make it more Aggro evil..and added some
more mobs and eq to enhance Goth's lengthy descriptions. Lord Gunthar,
Lord AMothus, as well as some catacombs are all new.
Kurse, Jan 98
~
81 0 0 0 0 1 255 0
S
#8101
Entrance to the Encampment~
   You are standing on a small, worn path leading to the group of tents you see
in the distance.  You can tell from the sounds of weaponsmiths hammering away, 
of catapults being drawn and loaded, and the cries of battle coming from men's
bellies, that you have somehow come across the seige of the Solamnic Knights
upon the most dreaded icon of evil in all Krynn: Dargaard Keep.  And, as you 
look upward, you can see the silhouette of Dargard Keep, its spires carved from
the pink granite of the mountain it rests on stretching up into the sky,
casting an ominous shadow on the land.  And you hope, with all your heart,
that the  Solamnic Knights succeed, because if they fail, you know that doom
will befall all of Krynn; a doom called Soth.
~
