#8102
The Soldier's Tent~
  As you look around this tent, you notice nothing out of the ordinary.  Rather
mundane, actually.  You realize that this tent is for the "less important" men,
the regular soldiers.  Surely the Solamnic Knights wouldn't have such a shoddy
tent, with holes in its ceiling letting in the cold night air.
~
