#8103
Inside the Encampment~
   As you wander around inside the Solamnic encampment, you can hear the cries
of battle more clearly. You see soldiers and knights running this way and that,
soldiers pushing massive catapults into position for attack, servants helping 
their masters don their armor, and seargants barking commands to their troops.
You also hear the soft, holy words of the Priests of Paladine blessing the 
troops as they prepare their final blitz against Dargaard Keep. And you sense
that when these mighty powers of good and evil clash, the only true victor will
be the Grim Reaper.
~
