#8105
Knight's Tent~
   As you enter this huge domed tent, you notice elaborate drawings on the 
sides and ceiling.  Bear skin rugs adorn the dirt floor of the tent, and the
center is occupied by a small, rectangular table with six wooden stools around
it.  In a corner of the tent, you see various pieces of armor; a dull looking
great helm, some greaves, and some gauntlets.  Obviously this tent was intended
for a little more than the common Solamnic Soldier.  Then you look straight up,
and notice a tapestry hanging from the  ceiling; that of a golden crown.
~
