#8109
An Elaborately Adorned Tent~
  As you enter this tent, you are immediately struck with its elaborate beauty.
Many religious symbols representing Paladine, the god of good adorn this tent.
Towards the back of the tent is a large oaken altar with the holy symbol of
Paladine carved into it. To the rear of this makeshift temple is a gate,
leading to a back room.  You cannot quite make out what is in there, but
whatever it is glows with the brightness of Paladine himself.
~
81 32776 0 0 0 0 255 0
D1
You are amazed how this gate could be latched to a tent. It looks like you 
could rip it from the tent easily, as this gate is made only from wood.
However, when you tug at the gate, a strange blue energy crackles from it,
sending you sprawling to the ground. Then you realize how this gate could
stop someone: It is protected by Paladine.
~
gate~
