#8117
Sir Ratleif's Tent~
   As you walk into this tent, you see a huge oaken table with 20 odd chairs
surrounding it, placed in the tent's center.  The sides of the tent are adorned
with tapestries depicting great battles of Solamnic history. Towards the back
of the tent is a weapons rack, with a huge longsword resting on it. Then a man
clad in golden armor enters the tent behind you, looks you over, and says
"State your business." while slowly resting his hand on the pommel of his sword.
~
