#8118
The Rose Tent~
   As you enter this tent, the first thing you notice is the red roses spread
all over the ground.  Beautiful tapestries hang on the sides of this luxurious
tent, all with a reddish tinge, adding to the rose theme of the tent. In the 
center of the tent hangs a huge tapestry of a single, red rose, symbolizing the
purity of these honorable knights.  You realize by the extreme extravagance of
this tent, that those of the Order of the Rose, must be the highest caliber
knights in all of Krynn.
~
