#8119
The Sword Tent~
   As you enter this tent, you are taken aback by the beauty of the paintings
on the walls.  On each side of the tent a different sword is painted. The north
side has a beautiful runed claymore on it. The east, a silver broadsword. The
west side has a crystal hilted rapier on it.  And the south side, a golden
longsword.  In the center, is a pedestal with a silver bladed two-handed sword
with golden runes running the length of the blade. The hilt is made of the 
purest gold, with the pommel ending in an enormous ruby.  And you know, this 
tent can only be that of the Order of the Sword.
~
