Before the Drawbridge~
   You are standing before what once was the longest drawbridge you've ever 
seen in your life. Spanning the Hundred-Foot-Wide Moat, this once sturdy oaken 
drawbridge now is now charred and burnt from the very fires that birthed the 
Death Knight known as Soth.
~
