#8121
Outside the Encampment~
   You walk outside the guard of the Solamnic encampment to a muddy
clearing. Looking back upon the camp, you feel a twinge of sorrow for the
Knights. Once revered and proud, they have become smaller groups..feared
and reviled by many inhabitants of the land. However, they have remained
strong and fearless, and have protected the people of Krynn from all that 
is evil. Far to the west you see their goal, the great city of Palanthas.
Always the bastion of strength and beauty, Palanthas has yet to fall to
the dark forces of Soth. These knights travel there to ensure its survival.
~
