#8126
The High Road to Palanthas~
   The road widens here and leads into the famed timberlands of Amothus,
ruler of Palanthas. Famed for their hunting, the Timberlands stretch for 
many miles outside the gates of the city, offering more protection to it
from armies of mounted riders. You decide that this would be a good place to
pitch camp and rest for the night.
~
