#8127
The High Road to Palanthas~
   Here, the road thins as it enters into a large grove of oaks. Yes,
before you is Amothus' Timberland, and after it..Palanthas itself. You
swell in excitement as you realize how close you are to the end of your
journey. You wipe the dust from your eyes and stride on, towards your goal.
~
