#8128
Beginning of Amothus' Timberland~
   As you get into the forest, the path widens considerably. You also
notice how well trodden the path is, much more so than the high road you
to this point. The woods before you present lush and beautiful
plantlife, and strong oak trees stand proudly before you, their leaves 
shimmering green from the warm sunlight bathing down upon them. You also
see a sign that reads: "Before you lies Lord Amothus' Timberland. All 
who would honor these woods and their creatures with respect are welcome.
The others....beware."
~
