#8129
In Amothus' Timberland~
   From all around you comes the sounds of the forest, swirling around
your head in perfect harmony.  As the myriad birds sing their songs and
dance their aerial dance, you come to realize the ultimate purity contained
within this forest.  And, as you walk through the forest, the huge oak
trees seem to stand guard along the path, lifting the sense of evil and
danger swelling in you, and replacing it with a sense of utter tranquility.
~
