#8136
The Gates of Palanthas~
   Before you is the portal to the awe-inspiring city of Palanthas.  The
drawbridge lies open, its fifty yard length spanning the shimmering blue
moat surrounding the city.  The portcullis, however, still blocks the way
into palanthas, its runed golden bars glowing brightly with the powerful
magical wards placed on them by some of the most powerful wizards of
Krynn...even some more powerful than that of Elminster of Shadowdale in
the realm of Toril.  On either side of the drawbrige, on the near side
of the moat stands two golden statues of noble-looking dragons, seemingly
standing watch over Amothus' Timberland.  Suddenly, the Gold Dragons come
to life, their eyes opening to reveal their profound wisdom.  Then, they
start padding toward you, and you are awe-struck...with just a little tinge
of fear in the back of your mind.
~
