#8137
Inside the gates of Palanthas~
   Palanthas.  Its very name is spoken with wonder and reverence, as it
is truely a great bastion of the forces of good.  Centuries have seen this
great city survive siege after siege of Takhisis' evil forces, trying to
breach its walls, but to no avail.  Palanthas has truely stood the test
of time, and is seen a bane against evil.  In fact, so pure of heart are
the people of Palanthas, that Paladine, god of good, has granted the people
the power to detect evil beings by merely looking at them.  
   As you stand just inside the gates, you look northward to Amothus'
palace rising up over the houses to the north.  Above you are two lookout
posts where faithful knights guard against evil.
~
