#8138
Guard Tower~
   As you enter the guard tower, you see the backs of several of Lord
Amothus' finest archers.  Their grim resolve is another testament to the
longevity of Palanthas.  In the corner lie several quivers of arrows and
replacement bows, which, as you look closer, seem magically endowed, as
per the runes carved into the bows.  To the east, you see a small rope
bridge leading to the guard tower on the other side of the gates.
~
