#8140
Rose Street~
   As you walk down Rose Street, named for the infamous Knights of the
Order of the Rose, you can see the beautiful houses of the noble and
wealthy of Palanthas.  Although there is neither famine nor poverty in
Palanthas, these are the homes of the "above average" citizens of Palanthas,
as their gold-framed windows, flowerbeds filled with the most exotic flowers
and plants, and beautifully decorated entryways portray.  
~
