#8142
Shrine to Paladine~
   As you reach the center of Palanthas, also the intersection of Rose
and Crown Streets, you look upon the most magnificently carved fountain
you've ever seen.  This shrine to Paladine, carved from the purest marble,
depicts Paladine himself, standing in front of a huge sun with his arms
outstretched, water flowing from his hands down into the basin of the
fountain, the water representing Paladine's love flowing down onto his
beloved Palanthas.  The water, as you look into it, is of the deepest blue,
and seems to be aflame with a light-blue aura.  You drink, and feel
rejuvinated from the pure liquid, as if you were drinking Paladines divine
lifeblood.  Then you realize Paladine is indeed blessed.
~
