#8145
Rose Street~
   You come to the end of Rose Street, still marvelling at all the 
beautiful houses and architecture. Though you were skeptical before you
can surely understand why it is rumored there is no poverty in this 
city. It is truly a magnificent place to be in. To the north is a large
building, made of the whitest stone. It rises higher than all the other
structures in the city, save the Tower, and serves as the city's
centerpiece. This is the residence of Lord Amothus, head of Palanthus'
government and military force. If there is a problem in the city, it 
is ultimately resolved in this building.
~
