#8146
A Luxurious Home~
   As you step off of Rose Street into this house, you are captivated
by the beauty of the furnishings.  Set in front of a fireplace of marble
lie three lounging chairs, cushioned by the softest feathers, and with
small, red roses intricately sewn into them.  Adorning the walls, your
eyes swim in a veritable sea of artwork, from gold-laced tapestries, to
the finest oil paintings, to the rarest vases of alabaster, set atop oaken
pedestals.  And then you notice a large tapestry -the figure of what you
can only be Paladine -hung over the mantlepiece of the fireplace, showing
the households devotion to the god of all good.  
~
81 0 0 0 0 1 255 0
D1
You see the cobblestoned Rose Street ahead.
~
~
