#8159
Sword Street~
   Barely able to be called a road, and conforming to the social structure
of the triad of Knighthoods of Solamnia, the dirt covered road of Sword
Street is home to the least wealthy class of Palanthas.  All along Sword
Street stand meager little cottages.  But though the owners had not the
money to lavish the outside with decorations, or even whitewash for that
matter, the general condition of these small homes is still quite admirable.
You find yourself wishing that all "poverty" was as prosperous as this.
~
