#8164
The Holy Church of Paladine~
   With spires reaching for the heavens, trying desperately to get close
to the one thing it cherishes the most, the Temple of Paladine acts as a
focal point for all of Palanthas's love and devotion to their god.  As you
look inside, you see beautiful stained glass windows, depicting the most
heroic champions of Paladine.  Holy symbols adorn the wall behind the lavishly
carved oaken altar.  And you know instantly, that this holy place is a
sanctuary to good...and a bane to all evil.
~
81 0 0 0 0 1 255 0
D1
You see the crossroads of Sword Street and Dragon Avenue.
~
~
0 0 8163
S
#8165
A Bronze Dragon's Chambers~
   As you enter one of the huge marble buildings that the legendary bronze
dragons call home, you are instantly enamored by the luxuriousness of the
place.  Plundered from Takhisis's evil minions such as the dreaded Draconians
and from other evil dragons, Gold and silver trinkets, figurines, and statues,
each studded with rare stones, line the walls.  Were you to ask, you would
find that each piece of treasure represents a victory against evil.  Then you
look to the center of the structure to find a bronze dragon, curled up and in
a deep sleep.  Then, without even opening an eye, the great juggernaut of the
sky lifts its arm and points a massive, razor-sharp claw at you, saying,
"I do belive that you are tresspassing".
~
