#8177
Guardian Road~
Aptly named, on Guardian Road is where Palanthas' barracks are located.
To the east you see a number of one story buildings, all made of stone and
very spartan looking. As you see the soldiers going to and fro from the
barracks, you realize why Palanthas has stood for so long. If the powerful
magics that protect Palanthas were ever to fail, these soldiers alone
would be more than a match for almost any size army set against them.
~
