#8178
The Guardsman's Barracks~
You have entered the first of 3 massive Barrack halls, the other two 
lying further down Guardian's road to the south. But you have no need to
see any others. The nature of this barracks alone underscores the complete
devotion to duty as shown by the Palanthian guardsman. Simple, with little
ornamentation, yet very functional, these barracks house over 70 guardsmen,
as the rows and rows of bunks indicate. At the back of the room is a
small armory, containing series of weapons and armor. Clearly, should the
need arise, the Palanthian Guard would be an admirable defense against
interlopers.
~
