#8179
A Guarded Hallway~
   You step into a richly furnished hallway. The walls and ceiling are
made of a oak, polished to a shiny finish. The floor is made of a fine
black tile which reflects your image flawlessly. On either side of the
hallway sit two guards who, upon seeing you, rise to block your passage
into the main chamber. One of the guards says: 'Lord Amothus has visitors,
you will have to return at a later date.' You notice the key to the
inner room dangling from his belt.
~
