#8180
Lord Amothus' Reception~
   You open the doors and enter into a comfortably furnished reception
area. Covered in lush carpet and fine tapestries, this is where Amothus
entertains many of his important (and rich) guests. To the north you
spot a private library and down to the east is a large dining room,
which looks like it could seat 100 people. In the northeast corner of
the room is a carved stone staircase leading to the next level. A number
of fine leather chairs and couches are arranged in this area as well.
~
