#8182
The Waiting Room~
   *If* you were cleared past the guard hallway, and then invited from
the reception area, you get to wait here! This sitting room is just
outside Lord Amothus' audience chamber, where he meets with city councilmen
and tradesmen daily to discuss city business. With the Dragonwars as of
late, Amothus has been so extremely busy that he has had no time to
speak to his regular subjects. The guard at the door rises quickly and
inquires as to why you are here, and who let you in?
~
