#8183
A Bronze Dragon's Chambers~
   As you enter one of the huge marble buildings that the legendary bronze
dragons call home, you are instantly enamored by the luxuriousness of the
place.  Plundered from Takhisis's evil minions such as the dreaded Draconians
and from other evil dragons, Gold and silver trinkets, figurines, and statues,
each studded with rare stones, line the walls.  Were you to ask, you would find
that each piece of treasure represents a victory against evil.  Then you look
to the center of the structure to find a bronze dragon, curled up and in a deep
sleep.  Then, without even opening an eye, the great juggernaut of the sky
lifts its arm and points a massive, razor-sharp claw at you, saying,
"I do belive that you are tresspassing".
~
81 520 0 0 0 1 255 0
D2
You can see a small stone path leading through the large buildings that house
the bronze dragons.
~
~
