#8184
Dragon Avenue~
   You see a road made of red brick, leading north towards several domed
structures as tall as mountains.  On either side of the road, stretching all
the way to the bronze dragons' lairs ahead, are rows of beautiful marble
statues of fallen Dragonriders atop their aerial companions, their dragonlances
forged of pure silver streaking into the sky.  As you look up at one of the
statues and into the emerald-cut eyes of a dragon statue, you feel an eerie
feeling wash over you, almost as if the dragon-or someone- was watching you.
~
