#8188
Entrance to the Dragon Domes~
   Called the Dragon Domes by the commoners of Palanthas, and simply "home" to
its inhabitants, The gigantic domed buildings before you even rival the size of
the nearby mountain range.  Also, as you look around, you see to the west some
smaller buildings, obviously the home of the legendary Dragonriders, for even
when not in battle, the dragons and their riders are inseparable.  To the
north, the several domes are bronze in color, but to the northwest and west,
you see even larger domed structures, one of silver, and one of gold.
~
