#8192
A Gold and Silver Path~
  Suddenly, as you walk westward, the path you were on becomes one wrought of
gold and silver, both entwining in each other, forming intricate patterns on
the ground.  As you follow the path, the silver and gold parts of the path
separate, the gold half curving north, and the silver part curving south.  Then,
as you look up, you realize that you're in a valley between two gigantic
mountains.  But as you look closer, you stare in awe at the sight before your
eyes.  You see that the peaks of either mountain have been replaced with
enormous domes, one of solid gold, and one of solid silver.  Instantly, as you
look upon these impossible wonders, that you've come to the last lines of
defense for Palanthas:  The Gold and Silver Wyrms, the two most powerful dragons
in all creation.
~
