#8193
The Great Silver Wyrm's Lair~
   The moment you walk inside the Silver Dragon's Lair, you are bathed in a
soft white light.  The entire cave, a solid silver, polished to a mirror
finish, reflects light from some unseen source, illuminating every corner of
the domelike cavern.  In the very center of the room, you see a gigantic
monolith of pure silver, with rubies in the shape of arcane runes stretching
the length of it.  Suddenly, the runes begin glowing a deep red, and you hear
a loud humming noise.  Then the side of the monolith that faces you swings
open, and you see a blinding light inside.  As your eyes begin to adjust, you
see the silhouette of a great winged creature, getting closer and closer. 
Then it flies out of the monolith and touches down in front of you.

The Silver Wyrm has returned.
~
81 520 0 0 0 1 255 0
D0
You see a path running through a lush mountain valley.
~
~
