S
#8194
A Small Street off the Main Road~
   Smaller and narrower than the main road that goes through the area of the
great domed structures that serve as homes to the dragons who serve Palanthas,
this road leads toward several smaller, man-sized buildings, looking like a
cross between barracks and a normal house.  Then you see two golden lances
adorning the entryway to these spartan homes, crossing each other at the peak
of the archway.  However, you notice something strange about these weapons of
chivalry.  They seem much larger and heavier than even the heaviest of war
lances the mounted knights use.  In fact you doubt that a horse could even
heft a weapon such as this.  To carry a lance of this magnitue into combat on
its back, a creature would have to have the strength of...a dragon.
~
