#8199
The Nursery~
   As you enter the arena-like dragon nursery, you are almost knocked to your
feet by a hatchling bronze dragon doing its best impression of flying.  You
look to the air to find several bronze hatchlings swooping and diving through
the air, tangled in a playful mock-battle, much like two kittens fighting over
a ball of yarn.  Back on the ground, you see, in the northwest corner, two
bronze colored eggs, standing about six feet tall.  Above them, hovering in
midair, floats a large, golden orb, bathing the eggs in a golden light, it's
aura keeping them warm and safe inside its protective glow.  You seem to
remember someone telling you how lucrative a price dragon eggs brought on the
black market.  But you also, vaguely, remember someone whispering of the great
magical powers contained within a dragon egg...
~
